Chapter: LinLaunderLocalLeak
  cites Foreword chapter Linear

 Probe (closed by LinearOwnership stage 2): aliasing the linear
 param to a let-local is a MOVE; the local inherits the exactly-once
 obligation. Dropping the local leaks the resource - CDX2063.

